> I am trying to get an X application to start automatically when our OSF/1 
> system boots up (V3.2C).

We do this by changing the "console" entry in "/etc/inittab" to run a script
instead of "getty". This script simulates a login (with an su -) to an
account that does a startx and runs the application.

