to provide 50% spare CPU capacity, and I would like to have my console
display the current CPU idle time.

  One implementation we have considered is to have a task run at the lowest
priority, that just counts in a while loop.  That task would be interrupted
at a set rate, say 2 Hz, at which time it would report the count value and
reset.  This is an acceptable solution, but I was wondering if OSF/1 (or
