  I have installed Screen 3.7.1 on our Digital Unix 3.2d system.  It runs
fine, except it does not seem to update the /var/adm/utmp file correctly.
Even after exiting from screen and logging off of the system, a finger
of the user will show logins from "host:S.x" x being the screen number.
