Tom-

POLYCENTER Manager on NetView for Digital UNIX is not sensitive to
the details of the agent implementation on managed systems.

On the management station itself (the one running POLYCENTER Manager
on NetView) either eSNMP or the Common Agent must be installed since
NetView implements agent extensions using.  Those extensions are written
for either agent, and the appropriate agent is chosen at install time based
on the OS version.

