   can get is an 8-bit visual.  We should be able to get a 16-bit visual
   at 1024x768 -- XFree86 & XInside can acheive this with the same hardware
   in a PC running Solaris, FreeBSD, etc.

d) We can only get a fixed set of resoltions, not including 1152x900.  Again,
